# after_prep_weak.voc — Time adverbs/pronouns that can follow BOTH a preposition and the
# finite verb 'pára' (amanhã, depois, sempre…). score_adp gives them only +2
# (weak) instead of +5, so they don't over-claim ADP. Extend cautiously.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

amanhã
depois
já
logo
ontem
quando
sempre
todos
